{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Shopping Spree"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Real Leather"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Comparisons"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">as</span> + adjective/adverb + <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons when the things we are comparing are equal in some way:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is <span class=\"strong\">as soft as</span> a sweater!</span><br/><br/>We use not <span class=\"italic\">as</span> ... <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons between things which aren't equal:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is<span class=\"strong\">n't as expensive as</span> that one.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't look as slim as I did last year. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Green is not as easy to wear as blue or rust or rose."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You need something that is not as fussy as this is."}, {"type": "example", "content": " She's as good as they get."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll take these to give you as much room as possible."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Responses with <span class=\"italic\">So</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Neither</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We us <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span> for positive and negative agreement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">So</span> is used to show agreement with positive statements. <br/>Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">too</span> to express the same thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I like this dress!</span></span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: <span class=\"italic\">So do I. / I do too.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Neither</span> is used to show agreement with negative statements. <br/>Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">either</span> to express the same thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I don't think this fits well.</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Neither do I. </span>(neither is a negative word)<br/><span class=\"italic\">I don't either. </span>(either is used with the negative)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>, the Auxiliary needs to agree with the verb tense in the original statement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A more colloquial form of positive agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me too</span>.<br/>A more colloquial form of   negative agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me neither</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Positive agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think a jacket would change the look of it as well.<br/><br/>I like them both.<br/><br/>I really loved that.<br/><br/>I think a jacket would change the look of it as well.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think so too.<br/><br/>Me too!<br/><br/>So did I. <br/><br/> So do I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I can't wear this shade of green though.<br/><br/>I don't see myself working in this.<br/><br/>I haven't seen anything else that has looked as good as the first outfit. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Neither can I.<br/><br/>I don't either.<br/><br/>Neither have I.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le07ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slim"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't look as slim as I did last year.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about clothing."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rust"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "reddish brown"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Green is not as easy to wear as blue or rust or rose."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vintage-look"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "looks like it was made in the past"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  It's a vintage-look top. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "boot-cut"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "looser at the bottom so boots can go inside"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example : I boug