span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Neither have I.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I really loved that.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So did I. That's a definite. The vintage-look top and boot-cut pants fit well.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I thought the price was right as well.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I did too!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The saleswoman really knows her stuff.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think so too. She's as good as they get.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: These two designer dresses are a wool blend. They're marked down.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I like them both.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn8le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "44200", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Me too!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: I'll take these to give you as much room as possible.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow Sal. That's very modern Lois Lane! If you threw a loose sweater over it, you could really dress it down. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think a jacket would change the look of it as well.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do I.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: This leather jacket will toughen it up for that big interview or big date!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Nice! I am having so much fun!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am too!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn8le07ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}